<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-title>Resetare parola - Dan fost anxios</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Reseteaza-ti parola pentru aplicatia Dan fost anxios</mj-preview>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f0f4fa">
    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          width="160px"
          src="https://api.danfostanxios.ro/assets/email-logo.png"
          alt="Dan fost anxios"
          padding="30px 0 20px"
          href="https://danfostanxios.ro"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 30px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="24px" font-weight="700" color="#13213c" line-height="1.3" padding-bottom="8px">
          Resetare parola
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#4d627f" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="16px">
          Ai solicitat resetarea parolei pentru contul tau din aplicatia <strong>Dan fost anxios</strong>. Apasa butonul de mai jos pentru a-ti seta o noua parola.
        </mj-text>

        <mj-button
          background-color="#4a90e2"
          border-radius="14px"
          font-size="16px"
          font-weight="700"
          color="#ffffff"
          href="{{resetUrl}}"
          padding="12px 0 24px"
          inner-padding="14px 36px"
        >
          Reseteaza parola
        </mj-button>

        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#6c8096" line-height="1.6" padding-bottom="12px">
          Daca butonul nu functioneaza, copiaza link-ul de mai jos in browser:
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="13px" color="#4a90e2" line-height="1.5" padding-bottom="16px" css-class="link-break">
          <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="color: #4a90e2; word-break: break-all;">{{resetUrl}}</a>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-divider border-color="#e5ecf3" border-width="1px" padding="8px 0" />

        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4d627f" line-height="1.6" padding-top="12px" padding-bottom="8px">
          Daca folosesti aplicatia mobila, introdu codul de mai jos in ecranul de resetare:
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="24px" font-weight="800" color="#4a90e2" letter-spacing="6px" text-align="center" padding="12px 0" css-class="token-code">
          {{resetToken}}
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="13px" color="#8a9fb5" line-height="1.6" padding-top="12px">
          Daca nu ai solicitat aceasta resetare, poti ignora acest email. Parola ta va ramane neschimbata.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#f7fafd" padding="20px 30px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" color="#8a9fb5" line-height="1.6" text-align="center">
          &copy; {{currentYear}} Dan fost anxios. Toate drepturile rezervate.<br />
          Ai nevoie de ajutor? Contacteaza-ne la <a href="mailto:support@danfostanxios.ro" style="color: #4a90e2;">support@danfostanxios.ro</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
